# Hintforge corpus .gitignore -- DENY-BY-DEFAULT.
# Nothing ships unless whitelisted below. User state/setup and dev scaffolding
# are excluded by NOT being listed.
*
!.gitignore
!*/

# --- Fixed spine (universal core per docs/corpus-format.md) ---
# NOTE: CHECKPOINT.md is universal core too, but is DELIBERATELY excluded here --
# it is per-user playthrough state (player name, dials). Do not add it.
!architecture_manifest.md
!items/**
!sections/**
!_overflow/**
!achievements.md
!controls.md
!dependencies.md
!limitations.md
!mechanics.md
!persona.md
!settings.md
!warning_tiers.md
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md
!DISCLAIMER.md

# --- Release presentation (README + status card) ---
!README.md
!assets/**

# --- Interactive artifact: the faction planner page and the script that rebuilds it ---
# Its spec, scratch screenshots and test seeds are dev-only and never ship.
!artifacts/faction_planner.html
!artifacts/artifacts.json
!extract_tools/build_faction_planner.py
!extract_tools/corpus_blocks.py
!extract_tools/faction_planner_template.html

# --- Declared vector-extensions (one !<ext>/** per manifest entry) ---
!factions/**
